{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"a1e4c0905b7d11f2","type":"group","x":0,"y":0,"width":3880,"height":360,"label":"Project Reading Entry","color":"4"},
		{"id":"b22f91d3ac4e6701","type":"file","x":80,"y":60,"width":420,"height":220,"file":"travelKnowledge/我的整理/Enhance Skill 整理/登录，路由，权限/request.js、api、config.js、web request.js 关系分析.md"},
		{"id":"c3381a5e7d9f204b","type":"text","x":560,"y":60,"width":930,"height":220,"color":"2","text":"## 核心结论\n\n共享 API 包只依赖 `RequestClient` 这个抽象入口。\n`web` 和 `uniapp` 在各自启动时，把自己的真实请求实现注册进去。\n\n这不是“共用同一个 axios 实例”，而是：\n- 共用同一套 API 函数定义\n- 共用同一份请求描述格式\n- 由不同平台注入自己的执行器"},
		{"id":"d449be0182ac73f4","type":"text","x":1560,"y":60,"width":1160,"height":220,"color":"5","text":"## 推荐阅读顺序\n\n1. 先看这份关系分析笔记\n2. 再看 `packages/api/src/config.js`\n3. 接着看 `packages/api/src/apis/**`\n4. 然后分开看 `sites/web/src/utils/request.js` 和 `sites/uniapp/src/utils/request.js`\n5. 最后补 `main.js` 与登录态来源\n\n如果要改：\n- 改接口定义，先看 `apis/**`\n- 改底层请求行为，先看各端 `request.js`\n- 改初始化时机，先看 `main.js`"},
		{"id":"e55c07a91db34e20","type":"group","x":0,"y":420,"width":2720,"height":1380,"label":"Architecture And Runtime Chain","color":"5"},
		{"id":"f60d2c4e918a7b31","type":"text","x":80,"y":930,"width":320,"height":220,"color":"2","text":"## 页面 / store 调用 `@travel/api`\n\nRole:\n- 运行时触发入口\n\nDoes:\n- 调用具体业务 API 函数\n- 不关心底层是 axios 还是 `uni.request`\n\nNext:\n- 把业务参数交给 `apis/**`"},
		{"id":"07a19f6cbe34d052","type":"text","x":500,"y":920,"width":360,"height":240,"color":"3","text":"## `packages/api/src/apis/**`\n\nLayer:\n- 共享业务服务层\n\nReceives:\n- `url / method / data / params / loading`\n\nDepends on:\n- `RequestClient(config)`\n\nAffects:\n- 统一描述“请求什么”\n- 把执行权交给共享入口"},
		{"id":"18bf40e2a6c57d63","type":"text","x":980,"y":900,"width":360,"height":280,"color":"3","text":"## `packages/api/src/config.js`\n\nLayer:\n- 共享运行时桥\n\nOwns:\n- `RequestClient` 当前实现引用\n\nReceives:\n- `setRequestClient(client)`\n\nCommunication type:\n- 运行时控制权注入\n\nAffects:\n- 决定后续 API 真正落到哪个平台实现"},
		{"id":"29c45df7b18e9064","type":"text","x":1460,"y":680,"width":420,"height":300,"color":"5","text":"## `sites/web/src/utils/request.js`\n\nLayer:\n- web 端运行时适配层\n\nUses:\n- `axios.create`\n- interceptors\n- `router` / `message`\n- `useAccountStore()`\n\nDoes:\n- 组装 `AUTHORIZATION` / `AUTHORIZATIONID`\n- 固定 `ACCOUNT_SOURCE = web`\n- 统一处理 `200/401/403/500/timeout`\n- `setRequestClient(requestFn)`"},
		{"id":"3ad6e70cb29fa175","type":"text","x":1460,"y":1160,"width":420,"height":320,"color":"5","text":"## `sites/uniapp/src/utils/request.js`\n\nLayer:\n- uniapp 端运行时适配层\n\nUses:\n- `uni.request`\n- `uni.getStorageSync`\n- `uni.reLaunch`\n\nDoes:\n- 读取 `AUTHORIZATION` / `AUTHORIZATIONID`\n- 固定 `ACCOUNT_SOURCE = app`\n- 统一处理登录失效\n- `setRequestClient(request)`"},
		{"id":"4be8f115c3a0b286","type":"text","x":1460,"y":500,"width":320,"height":140,"color":"2","text":"## `sites/web/src/main.js`\n\nTrigger:\n- App 启动\n\nDoes:\n- 先副作用导入 `@/utils/request.js`\n- 让 web 请求实现先完成注册"},
		{"id":"5cf90126d4b1c397","type":"text","x":1460,"y":980,"width":320,"height":140,"color":"2","text":"## `sites/uniapp/src/main.js`\n\nTrigger:\n- App 启动\n\nDoes:\n- 先副作用导入 `@/utils/request.js`\n- 让 uniapp 请求实现先完成注册"},
		{"id":"6d0ab237e5c2d4a8","type":"text","x":1960,"y":700,"width":340,"height":200,"color":"6","text":"## `sites/web/src/store/modules/account.js`\n\nSource of truth:\n- `token`\n- `accountId`\n\nUsed by:\n- `web request.js` 请求前直接读取\n\nMeaning:\n- web 端鉴权头真实来源在 store"},
		{"id":"7e1bc348f6d3e5b9","type":"text","x":1960,"y":1160,"width":340,"height":220,"color":"6","text":"## `sites/uniapp/src/store/modules/account.js`\n\nOwns:\n- `isLogin`\n- `accountInfo`\n\nWrites:\n- 登录成功后把 token / accountId 同步到 Storage\n- 退出登录时清理相关 key"},
		{"id":"8f2cd45907e4f6ca","type":"text","x":2360,"y":1160,"width":280,"height":220,"color":"6","text":"## Uniapp Storage\n\nKeys:\n- `AUTHORIZATION`\n- `AUTHORIZATIONID`\n- `ACCOUNT_SOURCE`\n- `loginInfo`\n\nUsed by:\n- `uniapp request.js` 请求前直接读取"},
		{"id":"90de65781af508db","type":"group","x":2780,"y":420,"width":1100,"height":1380,"label":"Key And Difficult Points","color":"1"},
		{"id":"a1ef76892b0619ec","type":"text","x":2860,"y":1120,"width":920,"height":260,"color":"1","text":"## 难点 1: 两端 source of truth 不同\n\nWhy it is hard:\n- web 请求时直接读 store\n- uniapp 请求时直接读 Storage\n\nEvidence:\n- `useAccountStore()`\n- `uni.getStorageSync(\"AUTHORIZATION\")`\n\nRisk:\n- 改 token 字段或同步时机时，两端要分别检查"},
		{"id":"b20f879a3c172afd","type":"text","x":2860,"y":780,"width":420,"height":260,"color":"1","text":"## 难点 2: `config.js` 很短但最关键\n\nWhy it is hard:\n- 看起来像“只有几行没做事”\n- 实际上它隔离了 API 层与平台层\n\nEvidence:\n- `let RequestClient`\n- `setRequestClient(client)`\n\nHow to read:\n- 把它理解成共享桥，不是请求器"},
		{"id":"c31f98ab4d283b0e","type":"text","x":2860,"y":500,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"1","text":"## 难点 3: 导入顺序就是初始化顺序\n\nWhy it is hard:\n- `main.js` 里的 `import '@/utils/request.js'` 很像普通工具导入\n- 实际是副作用初始化\n\nRisk:\n- 如果先调 API 再导入 request，`RequestClient` 尚未注册"},
		{"id":"d42fa9bc5e394c1f","type":"text","x":3340,"y":780,"width":440,"height":280,"color":"1","text":"## 难点 4: 这里传的不是 props，而是控制权\n\nCommunication type:\n- 不是值传递\n- 不是 emit 动作\n- 是“平台请求能力”的运行时注入\n\nWhy better:\n- `api` 层只管“请求什么”\n- `request` 层只管“怎么请求”\n- 平台差异不会污染 `apis/**`"},
		{"id":"e53fbacd6f4a5d20","type":"group","x":0,"y":1860,"width":3880,"height":480,"label":"Flow Explanation","color":"2"},
		{"id":"f64fb0cd7a5b6e31","type":"text","x":80,"y":1940,"width":860,"height":320,"color":"2","text":"## Main Flow: 启动注册\n\nType:\n- Main Flow\n\nTrigger:\n- App 启动执行 `main.js`\n\nCondition:\n- 默认启动路径\n\nSteps:\n1. `main.js` 先导入 `@/utils/request.js`\n2. 平台 `request.js` 调用 `setRequestClient(...)`\n3. `config.js` 保存当前平台请求实现\n4. 后续 `apis/**` 读取到已注册入口\n\nState / API / Cache:\n- 更新的是 `RequestClient` 引用\n- 还没有真实业务请求\n\nUI result:\n- 页面之后可以正常调用 `@travel/api`\n\nReturn / End:\n- 结束于“运行时已完成初始化”"},
		{"id":"05a0c1de8b6c7f42","type":"text","x":1000,"y":1940,"width":860,"height":320,"color":"2","text":"## Main Flow: 业务 API 调用\n\nType:\n- Main Flow\n\nTrigger:\n- 页面或 store 调用某个 `@travel/api` 函数\n\nCondition:\n- 默认成功路径\n\nSteps:\n1. `apis/**` 组装 `{ url, method, data, params, loading }`\n2. 调用 `RequestClient(config)`\n3. 当前平台注册的 request 实现真正发请求\n4. 统一结果返回给页面或 store\n\nState / API / Cache:\n- web 走 `axios`\n- uniapp 走 `uni.request`\n\nUI result:\n- 调用方拿到统一数据结构继续渲染\n\nReturn / End:\n- 返回业务页面或 store 逻辑"},
		{"id":"16b1d2ef9c7d8053","type":"text","x":1920,"y":1940,"width":860,"height":320,"color":"2","text":"## Branch Flow: web 鉴权链\n\nType:\n- Branch Flow\n\nTrigger:\n- `web request.js` 发请求前 / 收到鉴权异常时\n\nCondition:\n- web 环境\n- 或响应 `401/403`\n\nSteps:\n1. 从 `account store` 读取 `token/accountId`\n2. 写入请求头\n3. 请求失败且命中鉴权异常时触发 `logout()`\n4. `router` 跳回登录页\n\nState / API / Cache:\n- source of truth 是 web store\n- 请求层不直接读 `localStorage`\n\nUI result:\n- 正常时自动带鉴权头\n- 失效时回到登录页\n\nReturn / End:\n- 等待下一次登录建立新状态"},
		{"id":"27c2e3f0ad8e9164","type":"text","x":2840,"y":1940,"width":860,"height":320,"color":"2","text":"## Branch Flow: uniapp 鉴权链\n\nType:\n- Branch Flow\n\nTrigger:\n- `uniapp request.js` 发请求前 / 收到鉴权异常时\n\nCondition:\n- uniapp 环境\n- 或响应登录失效\n\nSteps:\n1. `account store` 登录后把关键字段写入 Storage\n2. `request.js` 通过 `getStorageSync` 读取\n3. 写入请求头并发请求\n4. 登录失效时清理状态并 `uni.reLaunch()`\n\nState / API / Cache:\n- source of truth 落在 Storage\n- `loginInfo` 可供恢复流程读取\n\nUI result:\n- 正常时自动带头\n- 失效时重开到登录页\n\nReturn / End:\n- 等待重新登录"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"3012a4b5c6d7e8f1","fromNode":"4be8f115c3a0b286","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"29c45df7b18e9064","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"副作用导入"},
		{"id":"4123b5c6d7e8f902","fromNode":"5cf90126d4b1c397","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"3ad6e70cb29fa175","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"副作用导入"},
		{"id":"5234c6d7e8f90113","fromNode":"f60d2c4e918a7b31","fromSide":"right","toNode":"07a19f6cbe34d052","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"调用业务函数"},
		{"id":"6345d7e8f9011244","fromNode":"07a19f6cbe34d052","fromSide":"right","toNode":"18bf40e2a6c57d63","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"RequestClient(config)"},
		{"id":"7456e8f901123355","fromNode":"18bf40e2a6c57d63","fromSide":"right","toNode":"29c45df7b18e9064","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"web 已注册时落到 requestFn"},
		{"id":"8567f90112334466","fromNode":"18bf40e2a6c57d63","fromSide":"right","toNode":"3ad6e70cb29fa175","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"uniapp 已注册时落到 request"},
		{"id":"9678011233445567","fromNode":"6d0ab237e5c2d4a8","fromSide":"left","toNode":"29c45df7b18e9064","toSide":"right","toEnd":"arrow","label":"headers: token/accountId"},
		{"id":"a789112334455678","fromNode":"7e1bc348f6d3e5b9","fromSide":"right","toNode":"8f2cd45907e4f6ca","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"写入鉴权 key"},
		{"id":"b89a223344556789","fromNode":"8f2cd45907e4f6ca","fromSide":"left","toNode":"3ad6e70cb29fa175","toSide":"right","toEnd":"arrow","label":"getStorageSync 读取"},
		{"id":"c9ab33445566789a","fromNode":"29c45df7b18e9064","fromSide":"left","toNode":"18bf40e2a6c57d63","toSide":"right","toEnd":"arrow","label":"setRequestClient(requestFn)"},
		{"id":"dabc4455667789ab","fromNode":"3ad6e70cb29fa175","fromSide":"left","toNode":"18bf40e2a6c57d63","toSide":"right","toEnd":"arrow","label":"setRequestClient(request)"}
	]
}